# Final Architectural Principle

Cartique must remain:

> A deterministic commercial intelligence layer with replaceable interfaces.

Features should be plugged into the decision engine, not bolted onto the storefront.

The goal is not to build more ecommerce features faster.

The goal is to build an architecture where adding the next 100 ecommerce features does not require rebuilding the first 10.
